  "notes": "TRANSITIVITY:\nIntransitive ({自動詞|じどうし})\n\nUSAGE:\n- {寒|さむ}さで{縮|ちぢ}こまる (to huddle from cold)\n- {恐怖|きょうふ}で{縮|ちぢ}こまる (to cower in fear)\nVividly describes making oneself physically smaller, whether from cold (sense 1) or from psychological pressure (sense 2).\n\nRELATED WORDS:\n- {丸|まる}くなる (to curl up)\n- {萎縮|いしゅく}する (to shrink, cower - more formal)\n- {縮|ちぢ}む (to shrink, contract)",
